## 🚫 INTERPRETATION RULES

### **NEVER Interpret As Basic:**
- "Simple dashboard" → Still generate full professional dashboard
- "Basic form" → Still generate enhanced form with animations
- "Quick table" → Still generate interactive table with all features
- "Plain button" → Still generate gradient button with effects

### **ALWAYS Interpret With Enhancement:**
- Any component request gets the full professional treatment
- Any layout request includes glassmorphic and gradient elements
- Any interactive element gets hover effects and animations
- Any data display gets search, filters, and professional styling

